flowchart TB
    subgraph CatalogueModule["Catalogue and Releases module"]
        CatInbound["Inbound adapters<br/>Public API · internal operator trigger"]
        CatApplication["Application use cases and ports"]
        CatDomain["Domain model and policies"]
        CatOutbound["Outbound adapters<br/>PostgreSQL · IGDB · clock · telemetry"]
        CatContract["Published application contract<br/>Rating eligibility evidence"]

        CatInbound --> CatApplication
        CatApplication --> CatDomain
        CatOutbound --> CatApplication
        CatContract --- CatApplication
    end

    subgraph RatingsModule["Ratings module"]
        RatInbound["Inbound adapters<br/>Authenticated API · BFF"]
        RatApplication["Application use cases and ports"]
        RatDomain["Domain model and policies"]
        RatOutbound["Outbound adapters<br/>PostgreSQL · identity · clock · telemetry"]

        RatInbound --> RatApplication
        RatApplication --> RatDomain
        RatOutbound --> RatApplication
    end

    RatApplication -->|Depends only on the narrow contract| CatContract

    subgraph External["Runtime dependencies"]
        Database[("PostgreSQL")]
        IGDB["IGDB API"]
        Identity["Identity Provider"]
        Telemetry["Telemetry platform"]
    end

    CatOutbound -. runtime I/O .-> Database
    CatOutbound -. runtime I/O .-> IGDB
    CatOutbound -. runtime I/O .-> Telemetry
    RatOutbound -. runtime I/O .-> Database
    RatOutbound -. runtime I/O .-> Identity
    RatOutbound -. runtime I/O .-> Telemetry

    NoCrossAccess["Forbidden:<br/>direct repository or table access<br/>between business modules"]
    RatApplication -.-> NoCrossAccess
    CatApplication -.-> NoCrossAccess

